   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1636",
   "x": 2370.399999999999,
   "y": 1492.0,
   "width": 321.0,
   "height": 20.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "1. PassContext にリソースへの経路が無い",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "1. PassContext にリソースへの経路が無い",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 11472,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 50754,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1637",
   "x": 2370.399999999999,
   "y": 1512.0,
   "width": 646.6000000000007,
   "height": 80.0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "text": "    30種以上あるパスが ResourceManager / AssetDatabase / RayEngine を直引き。\n    PassContext は既に RenderGraph / GraphicsEngine / RenderContext を配って\n    いるので、ここへ足せばパス側の緑矢印をまとめて消せる。\n",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "    30種以上あるパスが ResourceManager / AssetDatabase / RayEngine を直引き。\n    PassContext は既に RenderGraph / GraphicsEngine / RenderContext を配って\n    いるので、ここへ足せばパス側の緑矢印をまとめて消せる。\n",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 11479,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 50785,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1638",
   "x": 2370.399999999999,
   "y": 1592.0,
   "width": 484.2000000000003,
   "height": 20.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "2. GraphicsEngine → SceneManager / GameManager は層の逆流",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "2. GraphicsEngine → SceneManager / GameManager は層の逆流",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 11486,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 50816,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1639",
   "x": 2370.399999999999,
   "y": 1612.0,
   "width": 402.4,
   "height": 60.0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "text": "    描画層がシーンとゲームを見に行っている。\n    必要なデータはシーン更新側から積む形にしたい。\n",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "    描画層がシーンとゲームを見に行っている。\n    必要なデータはシーン更新側から積む形にしたい。\n",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 11493,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 50847,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1640",
   "x": 2370.399999999999,
   "y": 1672.0,
   "width": 360.4,
   "height": 20.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "3. MainEngine 直引きは「持ち物が欲しいだけ」",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "3. MainEngine 直引きは「持ち物が欲しいだけ」",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 11500,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 50878,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1641",
   "x": 2370.399999999999,
   "y": 1692.0,
   "width": 543.2000000000004,
   "height": 80.0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "text": "    ParticlePass / ParticleSimulation / MonitorPass が欲しいのは\n    ParticleBufferManager や PipelineStateManager。\n    PassContext か初期化時の引数で渡せば済む。\n",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "    ParticlePass / ParticleSimulation / MonitorPass が欲しいのは\n    ParticleBufferManager や PipelineStateManager。\n    PassContext か初期化時の引数で渡せば済む。\n",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 11507,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 50909,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1642",
   "x": 2370.399999999999,
   "y": 1772.0,
   "width": 377.8,
   "height": 20.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "4. 計測のためだけに描画層がエディターを見ている",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "4. 計測のためだけに描画層がエディターを見ている",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 11514,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 50940,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1643",
   "x": 2370.399999999999,
   "y": 1792.0,
   "width": 556.8000000000003,
   "height": 40.0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "text": "    RenderContext / GraphicsEngine → MainEditor はプロファイル用。\n    計測インターフェースを切って挟みたい。",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
